            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0000\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001:F003\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposal accurately populates the missing action and object fields from the text and refines the scope to the pre-filing condition. Under subparagraph (A), before filing an action under paragraph (1), the State attorney general must provide both written notice and a copy of the complaint to the Commission.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"supported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0001\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001:F006\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Proposal P0001 injects an extraneous internal URN into applies_to that has no basis in the text. Furthermore, pairing the action 'provide the notice described in that subparagraph before the filing of the action' with the object 'Subparagraph (A)' distorts the semantic relationship of the statutory exemption.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0002\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F006:F009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Proposal P0002 correctly resolves the missing action and object fields for the duty under clause (ii), faithfully capturing the governing condition referencing clause (i) and the temporal requirement to provide notice and the complaint simultaneously with filing.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"supported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
